      {"id": "R-TA6-N2", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "ta6_applicability", "strength": "GUIDANCE",
       "text": "Use on a minor road having low speeds; for higher-speed traffic conditions use a lane closure. Encoded in E-TA6-LOW-SPEED and E-TA6-MINOR-ROAD.",
       "condition": null, "action": null, "value": null, "value_max": null, "unit": null, "qualifier": null,
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N2"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N3", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "positive_protection", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "Additional positive protection devices may be used (Sect. 6M.02).",
       "condition": null, "action": null, "value": null, "value_max": null, "unit": null, "qualifier": null,
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N3"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N4", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "remaining_lane_width", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "Short-term use on low-volume, low-speed roadways without longer and wider heavy commercial vehicles: minimum lane width 9 ft.",
       "condition": {"all": [{"field": "duration", "op": "EQ", "value": "SHORT_TERM"}, {"field": "traffic_volume", "op": "EQ", "value": "LOW"},
                             {"field": "low_speed_road", "op": "EQ", "value": true}, {"field": "heavy_vehicles", "op": "EQ", "value": false}]},
       "action": "NINE_FT_LANE_ALLOWED", "value": 9, "value_max": null, "unit": "ft", "qualifier": "AT_LEAST",
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N4"], "overlaps": ["R-6N07-NINE-FT-OPTION"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N5", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "lane_shift", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "Where the opposite shoulder is suitable and wide enough, lanes may be shifted with closely spaced channelizing devices, keeping a 10 ft minimum lane width.",
       "condition": {"field": "opposite_shoulder_suitable", "op": "EQ", "value": true}, "action": "LANES_MAY_SHIFT",
       "value": 10, "value_max": null, "unit": "ft", "qualifier": "AT_LEAST",
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N5"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N6", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "advance_sign_choice", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "Additional advance warning may be appropriate, such as a ROAD NARROWS sign.",
       "condition": null, "action": "ROAD_NARROWS_SIGN_MAY_BE_ADDED", "value": null, "value_max": null, "unit": null, "qualifier": null,
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N6"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N7", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "positive_protection", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "Temporary traffic barriers may be used along the work space.",
       "condition": null, "action": null, "value": null, "value_max": null, "unit": null, "qualifier": null,
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N7"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N8", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "shadow_vehicle", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "The shadow vehicle may be omitted if a taper and channelizing devices are used.",
       "condition": null, "action": "SHADOW_VEHICLE_MAY_BE_OMITTED_WITH_TAPER", "value": null, "value_max": null, "unit": null, "qualifier": null,
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N8"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N9", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "truck_mounted_attenuator", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "A truck-mounted attenuator may be used on the shadow vehicle.",
       "condition": null, "action": "TMA_OPTIONAL", "value": null, "value_max": null, "unit": null, "qualifier": null,
       "status": "SOURCED", "sme_question": null, "interpretation": null, "source_ref_ids": ["SR-6P6-N9"]},
      {"id": "R-TA6-N10", "layer": "FEDERAL", "ta_id": "TA-6", "jurisdiction": null, "topic": "short_or_mobile_work", "strength": "OPTION",
       "text": "Short-duration work: the taper and channelizing devices may be omitted if a shadow vehicle with activated high-intensity lights is used.",
       "condition": {"field": "duration", "op": "EQ", "value": "SHORT_DURATION"}, "action": "TAPER_AND_DEVICES_MAY_BE_OMITTED_WITH_LIT_SHADOW_VEHICLE",
